## RSSService Live Test

```python
rss_service.compute_rss(ccne1_copy_number=6.0, rb1_loss=False)
→ RSSResult(rss=0.80, rs_high=True, triggers=['CCNE1_AMP(cn=6.0)'])

rss_service.compute_rss(rb1_loss=False, myc_amplified=False, cdkn2a_deleted=False)
→ RSSResult(rss=0.20, rs_high=False, triggers=[])

rss_service.compute_rss()
→ RSSResult(rss=None, rs_high=None, confidence='NONE')  ← no fabrication
```

