## End-to-End Flow

```
AK enters: CCNE1 copy number = 6
  ↓
RSSEntryForm → localStorage[ayesha_rss_inputs_v1] = {ccne1_copy_number: 6}
  ↓
useTumorBoardBundle → body.rss_inputs = {ccne1_copy_number: 6}
  ↓
POST /bundle → RSSService.compute_rss → rss=0.80, rs_high=true
→ profile["sae_mechanism_vector"]["rss"] = 0.80
  ↓
Cosine similarity: berzosertib trial (rss=0.20) scores LOWER for this patient
→ gem alone is the better match for RS-High patients
  ↓
L1.rss = { rss: 0.80, rs_high: true, triggers: ["CCNE1_AMP(cn=6.0)"] }
  ↓
PatientStrategyBoard → RS-High badge (amber) visible below IntelligencePanel
```

